        {
          "id": "984cbeeb-9302-4b2d-bbf1-2d9d5934a3c1",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "开心",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「管理员先生！赤道仪的说明书我看不懂，第三页那个图，像一只趴着的猫！」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "f674b311-bc4a-471d-a617-ca218b4ac8ab",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-me",
            "characterName": "我",
            "expression": "",
            "position": "",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": false,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「那叫极轴镜。放学教你。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "38b0b486-51e3-4b55-883b-0add8554ebbe",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "正午的广播准时响起：「午间预报——今夜多云，观星的各位死心吧☆」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "83836043-ba4d-41b9-aadd-68682b92797d",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "天台上，星野朝着广播塔喊：「报错了——！今晚肯定晴天！」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "3a79d128-e56c-4fb6-86b9-4d7739b9b4e8",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "广播切回音乐。听说那是广播部的日向葵，全校嗓门最大的天气预报员。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "8b341e5d-423d-4872-b21b-4cf9ce47c270",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "第一个周末，麻烦一起来了：追踪电机卡了壳，星图恰好缺了英仙座那页。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "dc5a789a-d7da-4d16-83df-afcffb9694ea",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "平静",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「兵分两路，还是孤军奋战？」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
