        {
          "id": "9a288867-10c6-4eac-a3a7-8c5b3f1ca318",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "图书馆顶层，旧天文年鉴的合订本积着十年的灰。她踮着脚，一页一页往下翻。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4cf33400-856e-421d-9e82-a222ee70192f",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "图书委员深月路过，一句话没说，从书架顶层抽出一本没人借过的年鉴，翻到折角那页递过来，走了。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "778b5585-8866-4b08-bf04-c8d12a077f60",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "正是英仙座那页。折角，是很多年前折的。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "d2390f35-6cfd-4405-9713-493bcaa66cd0",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "开心",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「找到了！英仙座——神话里是英雄柏修斯，拎着美杜莎的头。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c73a108d-825f-4fbe-b1f7-9bc62d71ab95",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-me",
            "characterName": "我",
            "expression": "",
            "position": "",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": false,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「你查得比我还快。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "630e0258-7457-428b-8763-28144c3171ad",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "平静",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「因为我想快点知道，我们要看的是一个什么样的故事。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2bf9b7a6-f042-4287-bc11-32b382b38f50",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "她把那页复印了两份，一人一张。纸边裁得歪歪的，但英仙座用红笔描过。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
