            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "第二十天。电机归位，第一张测试曝光成功。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "f35d2ad1-aeae-4d4f-95ad-9e29b74b063c",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "猎户座的腰带，在取景框里连成一条微微发抖的线。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "aab46526-2dc7-4526-8a9b-7dc51b246500",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "开心",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「拍到了！我们的——第一颗星！」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "63e0ed28-9010-4bfd-a172-825cfcac1cad",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "她把照片举过头顶对着太阳看，好像那样就能把它烤进眼睛里。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "2ea2a306-2288-4273-8d0f-10797158a9ad",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "开心",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「对了！跟这张照片合个影吧，第一颗星作证！」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "76025254-84b5-4860-a40e-5b17081f259c",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "快门按下。取景框里，她的轮廓糊成一团柔光，像没对上焦。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "74813d10-9b70-4c35-a0c6-11ccbb07505f",
          "type": "narration",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "",
            "voiceBlip": false,
            "voiceBlipPreset": "",
            "voiceBlipWaveform": "triangle",
            "voiceBlipBaseFrequencyHz": 340,
            "voiceBlipPitchRangeSemitones": 2.4,
            "voiceBlipDurationMs": 48,
            "voiceBlipVolume": 55,
            "voiceBlipMinIntervalMs": 42
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "重拍三次，三次都糊。",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "f61033fd-0f43-483e-a9b5-ed707bcd6269",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "props": {
            "disabled": false,
            "characterId": "char-hoshino",
            "characterName": "星野",
            "expression": "平静",
            "position": "right",
            "isFirst": false,
            "isLast": false,
            "showCharacter": true,
            "keepCharacter": true,
            "keepDialogue": true,
            "voiceHash": "e4fbba57c192831252e165b47322dd3d"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "「奇怪～相机大概拍不出我哦。」她说得理直气壮，「没关系，用眼睛存档就好。」",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
